      "message": "In my machine, `prefer_rlib: true` generates bigger file. (`11664` -\u003e `77888`). Am I missing something?\n\nHere\u0027s my configurations.\n`microdroid_init_debug_policy` size was `11664` and `microdroid_init_debug_policy1` is `77888`.\n\n\n```\nrust_binary {\n    name: \"microdroid_init_debug_policy\",\n    srcs: [\"src/init_debug_policy.rs\"],\n    stem: \"init_debug_policy\",\n    rustlibs: [\n        \"librustutils\",\n    ],\n    installable: false, // match with microdroid_init_rc.\n    bootstrap: true,\n}\n \nrust_binary {\n    name: \"microdroid_init_debug_policy1\",\n    srcs: [\"src/init_debug_policy.rs\"],\n    stem: \"init_debug_policy1\",\n    rustlibs: [\n        \"librustutils\",\n    ],\n    installable: false, // match with microdroid_init_rc.\n    prefer_rlib: true,\n    bootstrap: true,\n}\n```",
